        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Adec m'omiy Yuda",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 15:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mic pa nono pa nyikway Yuda cungo kwoŋ pecin pajo otundo yuthenge ma yupiny tundo i kew ma Edom, tundo i thim ma Zin i kamabor mere loyo yupiny. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.15.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.15.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 15:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aka kew pajo ma yupiny oringo wok i gike ma Nam ma Cumbi, wok i coŋino ma ŋiyo yupiny; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.15.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.15.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 15:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kadho yupiny to idho malo ma Akirabim, luwo gi Zin, to medere malo ma Kades Barineya, aka luwo gi Heziron, to medere kiri Adar, to goyo kona kidho Karka, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.15.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.15.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 15:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "yu Azimon, to wok kodi i pi ma mol ma Misir, aka tundo i gike mere i nam. Me labedo kew mewin ma yupiny. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.15.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.15.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 15:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aka kew ma yuwok ceŋ obedo Nam ma Cumbi, tundo i gike ma Yordan. Aka kew ma thenge ma yumalo ringo wok i coŋino ma nam wok i gike ma Yordan; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.15.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.15.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 15:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "aka kew no medere kiri Beth Hogla, to luwo gi yumalo ma Beth Araba; to kew medere kiri i tele pa Bohan, wod pa Ruben; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.15.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.15.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 15:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "to kew medere kiri Debir wok i milelo ma Akor, aka ameno yuthenge ma yumalo, goyo kona yu Gilgal, m'obedo kama ŋiyere gi kama idho Adumim, manitie yuthenge ma yupiny ma milelo; aka kew luwo gi pi ma Ensemes, to gik i Enrogel; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.15.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.15.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 15:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kenyo to kew medere i milelo pa wod pa Hinom i kamaloro pa Joyebus (meno Yerusalem) aka kew no medere kiri wi got ma ŋare kwoŋ milelo pa Hinom, yupodho ceŋ, i gike ma yumalo ma milelo pa Refayim; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.15.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.15.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 15:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kenyo to kew tele tundo i waŋ pi ma Nefitowa, aka wok kenyo kiri i tindin madongo ma Got Efron; onyo to kew goyo kona kidho Bala (meno Kiriath Yerim) ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.15.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.15.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 15:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "to kew goyo kona yupodho ceŋ ma Bala tundo Got Edom, luwo gi kamaloro ma yumalo ma Got Yerim (meno Kesalon) to loro piny tundo Bethsemes to luwo gi Timina; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.15.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.15.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 15:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kew kadho woko ma kamaloro matendere ma yumalo ma Ekiron, onyo to kew gondere kidho Sikeron, to luwo kadho i Got Bala, to wok kodi Yabinel; onyo to kew tundo i gike i nam. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.15.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.15.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 15:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aka kew ma yupodho ceŋ oyido obedo Nam madwoŋ gi thenge mere. Me a kew m'othoko nyikway Yuda cungo kwoŋ pecin pajo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.15.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.15.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Kaleb mako Hebron kodi Debir",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 15:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.15.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.15.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 15:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.15.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.15.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JDG.1.20"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Jothum 1:20",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Cungo kwoŋ or pa Rwoth ri Yosuwa, ŋatimoro omiyo Kaleb wod pa Yefune adec i dier nyikway Yuda, Kiriath Arba, meno, Hebron (Arba oyido obedo ba Anak.) ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.15.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.15.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 15:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "To Kaleb gweyo woko wok kenyo wot Anak adek: Sesay, Ahiman kodi Talmay, nyikway Anak. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.15.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.15.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 15:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wok kenyo go okidho malo kwoŋ jopiny ma Debir; aka nyingi Debir macon oyido obedo Kiriath Sefer. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.15.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.15.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 15:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "To Kaleb waco ni, “Ŋat'omonji Kiriath Sefer to mako, alamiyo go nyaran Akisa paka cege.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.15.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.15.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 15:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "To Othiniel wod pa Kenaz, omin Kaleb, mako, to Kaleb miyo go nyare Akisa paka cege. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.15.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.15.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 15:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Munyo Akisa obino bongi Othiniel, odwoŋo go ni wokway bamere ndelo. Munyo Akisa loro i wi punda pere, Kaleb openjo go ni, “Imito aŋo?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.15.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.15.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 15:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "To Akisa dwoko Kaleb ni, “Miyan silwany; paka onyo itieko jengan i lowo ma yupiny, miyan jwombe bende.” Ameno to Kaleb miyo go jwombe ma yumalo kodi ma yupiny.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.15.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.15.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Tindin madongo ma Yuda",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 15:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.15.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.15.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 15:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Me a gir'alunja pa nono pa nyikway Yuda cungo kwoŋ pecin pajo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.15.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.15.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 15:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tindin madongo m'obedo apa nono pa nyikway Yuda i witum ma yupiny, yuthenge ma kew kodi Edom, oyido jobedo Kabzil, Eder, Yagur, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.15.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.15.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 15:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kina, Dimona, Adada, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.15.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.15.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 15:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kedes, Hazor, Ithinan, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.15.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.15.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 15:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Zif, Telem, Beyaloth, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.15.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.15.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 15:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hazor Hadata, Kerioth Heziron (meno, Hazor), ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.15.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.15.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 15:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amam, Sema, Molada, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.15.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.15.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 15:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hazar Gada, Hesimon, Bethpelet, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.15.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.15.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 15:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hazarsual, Berseba, Biziothia, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.15.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.15.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 15:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bala, Iyim, Ezem, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.15.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.15.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 15:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Elitolad, Kesil, Horima, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.15.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.15.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 15:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ziglag, Madimana, Sansana, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.15.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.15.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 15:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
